# Atlas warm line — keep the existing names

Atlas owns login and the warm-line yes/no. The conferencer stays on prayphone-server. Do not merge `/agent` into the Atlas SPA unless asked.

## Live handoff (sacred)

`src/features/atlas2026/singlepane/data-access/prayphoneSubapp.ts` opens `/agent#atlas_access_token=…` (URL **fragment**, not sent to the server). `AgentAuthGate` on prayphone-server consumes and strips the hash.

## Capability

`atlas.fn_can_access_warmline_agent` returns `atlas.fn_has_permission('warmline_agent.access')`. Seeded for administrator and supervisor. Navigators need an exception. Do not rename the RPC. Do not add a sixth `role_key`. Do not use Admin Directory `featurePolicy` JSON as the source of truth.

## Do not

- Invent `prayphone_agent.access`
- Put JWTs in the query string
- Change kiosk camera, bridge protocol, or SignalWire join from this repo

